  "entity": "HCMv3.GeneralMasterInfo.Asset",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>Company assets that can be issued to employees — vehicles and equipment. Assets issued to an employee are recorded on the employee's record, and employees can request assets through self-service, which offers only active assets.</p><p>The descriptive details below are printed on the employee asset report.</p>",
